      <div class="muted" style="margin-top:12px">${x.defaultFeeds ? 'Sentinel reads three general searches (airdrops and campaigns, community ideas, crypto talk) plus what you add below. Posts appear under Market trends.' : 'Only what you add below is read.'}</div>
